# WF-14: `data/` used to be ignored wholesale, so the 3.7 MB of preset TLE,
# CZML and ISL fixtures existed only on the author's machine and in this
# module's own nested repo. A fresh clone of the parent, and the Docker image,
# got ntn-constellation WITHOUT the constellation data its own CLI presets read,
# so live_starlink_demo.py and walker_kuiper.py could not reproduce. The paper
# pins a release artifact, so "works on the machine it was written on" is the
# failure mode that matters here. The fixtures are now tracked; only genuinely
# regenerable local output stays ignored.
.venv/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
# Root-level fetch cache only. The caches UNDER data/ are pinned preset inputs:
# a preset that refetches from CelesTrak is not a preset, and cannot reproduce
# offline or at a fixed epoch.
/.tle-cache/
dist/
build/
*.whl
*.tar.gz
